 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official OS Config API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Patch deployments are configuration metadata: no patch job is ever executed on any VM, no execution time is computed, and pause, resume and patch jobs are not implemented. Exactly one of oneTimeSchedule and recurringSchedule is required, and schedules cannot be updated. OS policy assignments are not served because they live in zone locations.",
  "title": "VM Manager (OS Config) (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
